+# Claim boundary
+
+```yaml
+actual_current_surface_status: conditional-support
+target_claim_type: bounded_theorem
+trace_class: frontier_discovery
+reachability_to_target: unknown_frontier
+conditional_surface_status: supplied quadratic vector action, positive constants and constant unit direction
+hypothetical_axiom_status: candidate action explored without framework adoption
+admitted_observation_status: no measured data in theorem or controls
+claim_type_reason: explicit causal local realization of a specified homogeneous static response
+audit_required_before_effective_retained: true
+bare_retained_allowed: false
+```
+
+Supplied mathematical hypotheses, diagnostic numerical controls, independent
+source review and eventual audit authority are distinct. No framework primitive
+or repository theorem supplies the action, physical readout or background.
+The construction is positive; it makes no universal negative claim over other
+completions. Matter energy, a nonlinear response, metric/lensing and empirical
+identification remain open. No formal audit or landing is authorized here.
