+# Portable milestone handoff
+
+Primary files are the local-vector homogeneous-response theorem note and its
+same-named runner under docs/ and scripts/. The runner declares its paired note
+as an integrity input and a60-second execution cap. Its standard output is
+repeatable; optional JSON sidecars use exclusive creation. The single recorded
+canonical execution uses the same-run JSON sidecar. Raw return and input/source
+identities are preserved under evidence/. Numerical samples support, rather
+than replace, the complete continuum proof.
+
+This milestone retains the direct author's positive construction only. The
+campaign's failed transfer and nine-source fits remain recoverable on its own
+branch and are not imported as empirical support. Review readiness is recorded
+in independent reports and immutable unit receipts; this note does not grant a
+review or audit verdict. Do not merge, push main, restart a retired author or
+extend the parent deadline. The next scientific target is the nonlinear
+source/background and physical matter coupling.
